### ============================================================

### DEALER ONBOARDING - TEST HTTP

### ============================================================

### 1. Get all dealers

GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/dealer/Dealers

### ============================================================

### 2. Create Dealer

### ============================================================

POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/dealer/Dealers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dealerName": "DEF Motors",
  "gstNumber": "29DEFAB1234D1Z5",
  "panNumber": "DEFAB1234D",
  "email": "def.motors@gmail.com",
  "phone": "9876543212",
  "address": "Bangalore"
}

### ============================================================

### 3. Get Dealer by ID

### Replace the ID with the ID returned from Create Dealer

### ============================================================

GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/dealer/Dealers(2e2f02d2-41f5-4428-beea-eb49a0797677)

### ============================================================

### 4. Update Dealer

### ============================================================

PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/dealer/Dealers(797ec2e3-3d55-4a90-9733-6c49f52907e5)
Content-Type: application/json

{
"address": "Bangalore, Karnataka"
}

### ============================================================

### 5. Submit Dealer

### ============================================================

POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/dealer/Dealers(797ec2e3-3d55-4a90-9733-6c49f52907e5)/submitDealer
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ============================================================

### 6. Approve Dealer

### ============================================================

POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/dealer/Dealers(797ec2e3-3d55-4a90-9733-6c49f52907e5)/approveDealer
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ============================================================

### 7. Reject Dealer

### ============================================================

POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/dealer/Dealers(797ec2e3-3d55-4a90-9733-6c49f52907e5)/rejectDealer
Content-Type: application/json

{
"reason": "GST verification failed"
}

### ============================================================

### 8. Block Dealer

### ============================================================

POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/dealer/Dealers(797ec2e3-3d55-4a90-9733-6c49f52907e5)/blockDealer
Content-Type: application/json

{
"reason": "Dealer compliance issue",
"remarks": "Blocked for review"
}

### ============================================================

### 9. Delete Dealer

### Expected: 405 - deletion not allowed

### ============================================================

DELETE http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/dealer/Dealers(797ec2e3-3d55-4a90-9733-6c49f52907e5)


### Submit Dealer

POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/dealer/Dealers(2e2f02d2-41f5-4428-beea-eb49a0797677)/submitDealer
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### Verify Dealer Status After Submit

GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/dealer/Dealers(2e2f02d2-41f5-4428-beea-eb49a0797677)
